    "The current remote database was reset, so all ten tables may be created from an empty state.",
    "Owner row grants are attached when rows are created; no real user IDs belong in this manifest.",
    "Appwrite Cloud Free does not support encrypted columns; sensitive text relies on TLS plus strict row permissions until a reviewed client-side encryption or plan-upgrade decision."
